    // shadcn CLI -> micromatch -> braces); no user-controlled glob input.
    //
    // REVIEW BY: 2026-11-09. audit-ci has no native expiry, so this date is NOT
    // enforced. Remove this entry as soon as a patched braces ships (Dependabot
    // will propose the bump).
    "GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm"
